  "bodyHash": "3jNMj0pz1rY=",
  "content": "<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/640620/description_9acb8d4e-5247-4ff2-9345-a2e9bb70f0a6.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"399\" height=\"363\"></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>這是一個能讓礦物更容易自動化的模組！</strong></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>搭配自動挖礦機使用，你再也不用擔心礦物問題</strong></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><br></strong>VVVVVVV<strong>模組重製版，點擊標題查看</strong>VVVVVVV<strong><br></strong></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/infgen-remake\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/640620/description_2ae92b98-416a-42c2-a666-d9962dccab7a.png\" alt=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/infgen-remake\" width=\"507\" height=\"147\"></a><br>^^^^^^^模組重製版，點擊標題查看^^^^^^^</strong></p><hr><p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>模組新增2種方塊，稱為「礦物產生器」，共有兩種類型</strong></p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><strong><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/640620/description_af797bd3-9c4f-4ff0-96bc-9d2ee9aa6709.png\" alt=\"https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/941333345760063558/1144516125988749432/gendsn.png\" width=\"482\" height=\"241\"></strong></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><strong><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/640620/description_92b370b6-c089-4f67-accc-8368de312a32.png\" width=\"330\" height=\"110\"></strong></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>每種類型都有5個等級</strong></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>每個產生器都需要一個特殊核心來製作，核心掉落時可能會引發混亂</strong></p><hr><p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>模組也為產生器加入了升級項目：</strong></p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/640620/description_5718debf-7243-40e6-b4bb-4c3a8b28b6d6.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"850\" height=\"283\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><hr><p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>當你獲得第5級產生器時，可以放入礦物模板，使其只生成一種礦物！</strong></p><p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/640620/description_6fbd74c7-b259-4a7d-ad33-5be30583453d.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"678\" height=\"226\"></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\">其他作品：</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a style=\"font-weight:400;font-family:Lato, &amp;#x27;background-color:rgb(13, 13, 13);color:#e5e5e5\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/mores-tooles\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"float:left\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/640620/description_14a08f0c-1970-4f70-8ea3-4d56cad5100d.png\" alt=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/mores-tooles\" width=\"332\" height=\"302\"></a></p><h6 style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</h6><h6 style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</h6><h6 style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/smeltin\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"font-weight:400\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/640620/description_84a5fcba-decc-4c05-8bac-d80acd979662.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"424\" height=\"93\"></a></h6><h6 style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</h6><h6 style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</h6><h6 style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</h6><h6 style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</h6><h6 style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</h6><h6 style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</h6><p>&nbsp;</p><pre style=\"text-align:center\">（點擊標題查看<span style=\"font-size:16px\">&nbsp;模組詳情）</span></pre>",
